OL,3,A'It's been killing me!' Celebrity
OL,4,ATraitors winners relieved the secret is
OL,5,Aout
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpoiler warning: This story reveals
OL,8,Fdetails of The Celebrity Traitors final
OL,10,FThe winners of Celebrity Traitors have
OL,11,Fsaid they are relieved that they no
OL,12,Flonger need to keep the biggest secret
OL,13,Fin British TV, as they reunited to
OL,14,Fcelebrate their victory.
OL,16,FActor Sebastian Croft and comedian
OL,17,FRomesh Ranganathan were the last ones
OL,18,Fstanding, with the two faithfuls
OL,19,Fsplitting the #83,000 prize pot between
OL,20,Ftheir chosen charities.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
